#. ja: ファイナー・マイナー
#. de: Minenmeister
#. fr: Bonne pioche<nbsp>!
#. column 40: Swing to determine the<br>number of mining attempts.<br>The fewer attempts available,<br>the higher the payout!<br><br>Titan → 4 times<br>Morbol → 5 times<br>Cactuar → 6 times
#. column 41: Swing the pickaxe to locate the<br>hidden ore. The closer you are, the<br>more the mining gauge is reduced.<br>You win if the gauge reaches zero<br>before you run out of attempts.
#. column 42: MGP Earned
#, aeria-term-model-exception: miner d0587d645ccb
msgctxt "GoldSaucerArcadeMachine:2359301:0:39"
msgid "The Finer Miner"
msgstr "Золотая жила"

#. ja: タイミングよく、<br>ツルハシを振り下ろそう！<br><br>ゲージの止まった位置によって、<br>採掘可能な回数が決まります。<br><br>タイタン：4回<br>モルボル：5回<br>サボテンダー：6回<br><br>採掘可能な回数が少ないほど、<br>獲得できるMGPが多くなります。
#. de: Wähle den Schwie<shy>rig<shy>keits<shy>grad!<br>Je weniger Versuche du hast, desto schwieriger ist es, die richtige Stelle im Gestein zu finden, aber desto größer ist der Gewinn.<br><br>Titan: 4 Versuche<br>Morbol: 5 Versuche<br>Sabotender: 6 Versuche
#. fr: Choisissez le bon moment pour donner un coup de pioche<nbsp>!<br><br>Le nombre de tentatives varie en fonction du niveau de la jauge.<br> Titan<nbsp>: 4<br> Morbol<nbsp>: 5<br> Pampa<nbsp>: 6<br><br>Moins vous avez de tentatives, plus de PGS vous obtiendrez<nbsp>!
#. column 39: The Finer Miner
#. column 41: Swing the pickaxe to locate the<br>hidden ore. The closer you are, the<br>more the mining gauge is reduced.<br>You win if the gauge reaches zero<br>before you run out of attempts.
#. column 42: MGP Earned
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "GoldSaucerArcadeMachine:2359301:0:40"
msgid "Swing to determine the<br>number of mining attempts.<br>The fewer attempts available,<br>the higher the payout!<br><br>Titan → 4 times<br>Morbol → 5 times<br>Cactuar → 6 times"
msgstr "Замахнись и узнай,<br>сколько будет попыток.<br>Чем меньше попыток,<br>тем выше награда!<br><br>Титан → 4 попытки<br>Морбол → 5 попыток<br>Кактуар → 6 попыток"

#. ja: ツルハシを振り下ろして採掘しよう！<br><br>手応えを頼りに、<br>採掘に適したポイントを探してください。<br>ゲージがゼロになると、採掘成功！
#. de: Schlage das Erz aus dem Gestein!<br>Je näher du an der richtigen Stelle triffst, desto schneller leert sich der Balken. Wenn er leer ist, hast du gewonnen!
#. fr: Donnez un coup de pioche pour creuser<nbsp>!<br><br>Utilisez votre instinct pour trouver le bon filon<nbsp>!<br><br>Réduisez la jauge à zéro pour gagner<nbsp>!
#. column 39: The Finer Miner
#. column 40: Swing to determine the<br>number of mining attempts.<br>The fewer attempts available,<br>the higher the payout!<br><br>Titan → 4 times<br>Morbol → 5 times<br>Cactuar → 6 times
#. column 42: MGP Earned
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "GoldSaucerArcadeMachine:2359301:0:41"
msgid "Swing the pickaxe to locate the<br>hidden ore. The closer you are, the<br>more the mining gauge is reduced.<br>You win if the gauge reaches zero<br>before you run out of attempts."
msgstr "Ударь киркой и найди<br>спрятанную руду. Чем ближе попадание,<br>тем сильнее падает шкала добычи.<br>Победа за тобой, если шкала опустеет,<br>пока попытки ещё не закончились."

#. ja: 現在の獲得MGP
#. de: MGP-Gewinn
#. fr: PGS obtenus
#. column 39: The Finer Miner
#. column 40: Swing to determine the<br>number of mining attempts.<br>The fewer attempts available,<br>the higher the payout!<br><br>Titan → 4 times<br>Morbol → 5 times<br>Cactuar → 6 times
#. column 41: Swing the pickaxe to locate the<br>hidden ore. The closer you are, the<br>more the mining gauge is reduced.<br>You win if the gauge reaches zero<br>before you run out of attempts.
msgctxt "GoldSaucerArcadeMachine:2359301:0:42"
msgid "MGP Earned"
msgstr "Получено MGP"

#. ja: アウト・オン・ア・リム
#. de: Axt-im-Wald
#. fr: Oh, la hache<nbsp>!
#. column 40: Swing to determine<br>the gauge speed.<br>The higher the speed,<br>the higher the payout!<br><br>Titan → Very fast<br>Morbol → Fast<br>Cactuar → Slow
#. column 41: Swing the hatchet to locate the<br>hidden timber. The closer you are,<br>the more the gathering gauge is reduced.<br>You win if the gauge reaches zero<br>before you run out of attempts.
#. column 42: MGP Earned
msgctxt "GoldSaucerArcadeMachine:2359302:0:39"
msgid "Out on a Limb"
msgstr "Руби с плеча"

#. ja: タイミングよく、<br>手斧を打ち込もう！<br><br>ゲージの止まった位置によって、<br>採集の速度が決まります。<br><br>タイタン：とても速い<br>モルボル：速い<br>サボテンダー：遅い<br><br>速度が速いほど、<br>獲得できるMGPが多くなります。
#. de: Wähle den Schwie<shy>rig<shy>keits<shy>grad!<br>Je schneller sich der Zeiger bewegt, desto schwieriger ist es, den Stamm an der richtigen Stelle zu treffen, aber desto größer ist der Gewinn.<br><br>Titan: sehr schnell<br>Morbol: schnell<br>Sabotender: langsam
#. fr: Choisissez le bon moment pour donner un coup de hache<nbsp>!<br><br>La vitesse varie en fonction du niveau de la jauge.<br> Titan<nbsp>: très rapide<br> Morbol<nbsp>: rapide<br> Pampa<nbsp>: lent<br><br>Plus ça va vite, plus vous obtiendrez de PGS<nbsp>!
#. column 39: Out on a Limb
#. column 41: Swing the hatchet to locate the<br>hidden timber. The closer you are,<br>the more the gathering gauge is reduced.<br>You win if the gauge reaches zero<br>before you run out of attempts.
#. column 42: MGP Earned
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "GoldSaucerArcadeMachine:2359302:0:40"
msgid "Swing to determine<br>the gauge speed.<br>The higher the speed,<br>the higher the payout!<br><br>Titan → Very fast<br>Morbol → Fast<br>Cactuar → Slow"
msgstr "Замахнись и узнай,<br>с какой скоростью пойдёт дело.<br>Чем выше скорость,<br>тем выше награда!<br><br>Титан → Очень быстро<br>Морбол → Быстро<br>Кактуар → Медленно"

#. ja: 手斧を打ち込んで伐採しよう！<br><br>手応えを頼りに、<br>伐採に適したポイントを探してください。<br>ゲージがゼロになると、伐採成功！
#. de: Fäll den Baum!<br>Je näher du an der richtigen Stelle triffst, desto schneller leert sich der Balken. Wenn er leer ist, hast du gewonnen!
#. fr: Donnez un coup de hache pour couper<nbsp>!<br><br>Utilisez votre instinct pour trouver le bon endroit<nbsp>!<br><br>Réduisez la jauge à zéro pour gagner<nbsp>!
#. column 39: Out on a Limb
#. column 40: Swing to determine<br>the gauge speed.<br>The higher the speed,<br>the higher the payout!<br><br>Titan → Very fast<br>Morbol → Fast<br>Cactuar → Slow
#. column 42: MGP Earned
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "GoldSaucerArcadeMachine:2359302:0:41"
msgid "Swing the hatchet to locate the<br>hidden timber. The closer you are,<br>the more the gathering gauge is reduced.<br>You win if the gauge reaches zero<br>before you run out of attempts."
msgstr "Ударь топориком и найди<br>спрятанное бревно. Чем ближе попадание,<br>тем сильнее падает шкала заготовки.<br>Победа за тобой, если шкала опустеет,<br>пока попытки ещё не закончились."

